{"headword":"שְׁאֵר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:26\" href=\"/Psalms.73.26\">ψ 73:26</a></sup> <strong>flesh (</strong>perhaps orig. the inner flesh, full of blood, next the bones, cf. Hoffm<sup>ZAW iii (1883), 107</sup>, and <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּשָׂר</span> = (orig.) flesh next the skin<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:20\" href=\"/Psalms.78.20\">ψ 78:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:27\" href=\"/Psalms.78.27\">27</a>, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:3\" href=\"/Micah.3.3\">Mi 3:3</a> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:35\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.35\">Je 51:35</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:26\" href=\"/Psalms.73.26\">ψ 73:26</a>, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>flesh:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"as food, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:10\" href=\"/Exodus.21.10\">Ex 21:10</a> (HPS also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.24\">1 S 9:24</a>, for <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנִּשְׁאָר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:20\" href=\"/Psalms.78.20\">ψ 78:20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:27\" href=\"/Psalms.78.27\">27</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עוֹף בָּנָף</span>); fig. <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:2\" href=\"/Micah.3.2\">Mi 3:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עוֹר</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:3\" href=\"/Micah.3.3\">3</a> (‖ id.), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:35\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.35\">Je 51:35</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּם</span>)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. for physical power <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:26\" href=\"/Psalms.73.26\">ψ 73:26</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵבָב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.11\">Pr 5:11</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּשָׂר</span>)."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"in HP = <em>flesh</em>- (= blood-) <em>relation</em> (i.e. one near of kin): <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵר אָבִיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.12\">Lv 18:12</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.19\">20:19</a>, also <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.17\">18:17</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵרְךָ</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲרָה</span>, 𝔊 Ew Dr-Wh; cf. Di Baen); + <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקָּרֹב אֵלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.2\">21:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:11\" href=\"/Numbers.27.11\">Nu 27:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ בְּשָׂרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.6\">Lv 18:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:49\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.49\">25:49</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"= <em>self</em>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.17\">Pr 11:17</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶשׁ</span>)."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB09870","strong_numbers":["7607","7608"],"next_hw":"שַׁאֲרָה","prev_hw":"שׁאר","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8638","8640"],"TWOT":["2308a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}